    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "meta_prompting_text",
      "x": 1850,
      "y": 156,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 98,
      "text": "EXECUTION  \u00b7  AGENT LOOP  +  LANGGRAPH\n\nWithin a stage: each LLM-touching stage is\nan agent (claude-agent-sdk) with file tools\n(Read paginated, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep) and\ntyped structured-output tools.\n\nBetween stages: LangGraph orchestrates the\ngraph \u2014 sequential foundation, parallel\nbranches after Stage 7, conditional retries,\nSQLite checkpointing for resumability. Full\ntopology: langgraph-orchestration.excalidraw\n\nWorking dir per agent: data/<slug>/\nOnly Stage 8B is deterministic (no LLM).",
      "originalText": "EXECUTION  \u00b7  AGENT LOOP  +  LANGGRAPH\n\nWithin a stage: each LLM-touching stage is\nan agent (claude-agent-sdk) with file tools\n(Read paginated, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep) and\ntyped structured-output tools.\n\nBetween stages: LangGraph orchestrates the\ngraph \u2014 sequential foundation, parallel\nbranches after Stage 7, conditional retries,\nSQLite checkpointing for resumability. Full\ntopology: langgraph-orchestration.excalidraw\n\nWorking dir per agent: data/<slug>/\nOnly Stage 8B is deterministic (no LLM).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7c2d12",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
