      "text": "STAGE 0  \u00b7  Spec Seed  (AGENT)\n\nOpus 4.7 agent  \u00b7  idempotent\nFile tools: Write\nStructured tool: write_persona_spec()\n\nWrites persona_origin.md (prose) +\npersonas/<slug>.yaml (via typed tool).",
