      "y": 405,
      "width": 1010,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "OUTPUTS\n\n[STRUCT]  personas/<slug>.yaml         thin: slug, name, prompt_text, created_at, seed=hash(prompt)\n[PROSE]   internal/persona_origin.md     magazine-feature opening \u2014 3\u20136 paragraphs anchoring the persona",
