    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_1a_text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "STAGE 1a \u00b7 Life Context  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\n\nMulti-section life narrative covering 6 domains:\nProfessional \u00b7 Family \u00b7 Health \u00b7 Relationships \u00b7\nFinances \u00b7 Identity & Purpose.\n\nAgent reads persona_origin.md (paginated), then\ndrafts life_context.md domain by domain via Write,\nthen weaves cross-domain tensions via Edit.\nMulti-pass output \u2014 too large for a single completion.",
      "originalText": "STAGE 1a \u00b7 Life Context  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\n\nMulti-section life narrative covering 6 domains:\nProfessional \u00b7 Family \u00b7 Health \u00b7 Relationships \u00b7\nFinances \u00b7 Identity & Purpose.\n\nAgent reads persona_origin.md (paginated), then\ndrafts life_context.md domain by domain via Write,\nthen weaves cross-domain tensions via Edit.\nMulti-pass output \u2014 too large for a single completion.",
