    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_1b_text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "STAGE 1b \u00b7 Character Sketch  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\n\nBack-stage biographical sketch, 2,000\u20134,000 words.\nThe novelist's bible: blind spots, failure modes,\nrecurring patterns, identity roles, what they conceal.\n\nAgent reads persona_origin.md + life_context.md\npaginated, then drafts the sketch in multiple passes.\nBig Five mentioned in sentences where load-bearing \u2014\nNEVER as a structured prelude with scores.",
      "originalText": "STAGE 1b \u00b7 Character Sketch  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\n\nBack-stage biographical sketch, 2,000\u20134,000 words.\nThe novelist's bible: blind spots, failure modes,\nrecurring patterns, identity roles, what they conceal.\n\nAgent reads persona_origin.md + life_context.md\npaginated, then drafts the sketch in multiple passes.\nBig Five mentioned in sentences where load-bearing \u2014\nNEVER as a structured prelude with scores.",
