    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_1c_text",
      "x": 1370,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "STAGE 1c \u00b7 Judgment Reasoning  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\n\nEssay: 'How <Name> decides what matters this month.'\nWalks through what fires them up, what they suppress,\nhow context shifts these. Biases mentioned by name\nin prose where they apply.\n\nAgent reads upstream foundation paginated, then writes\nthe essay section by section. Not dimensions \u00d7 elevators\n\u00d7 tables \u2014 a multi-section essay.",
      "originalText": "STAGE 1c \u00b7 Judgment Reasoning  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\n\nEssay: 'How <Name> decides what matters this month.'\nWalks through what fires them up, what they suppress,\nhow context shifts these. Biases mentioned by name\nin prose where they apply.\n\nAgent reads upstream foundation paginated, then writes\nthe essay section by section. Not dimensions \u00d7 elevators\n\u00d7 tables \u2014 a multi-section essay.",
