      "id": "stage_1d_text",
      "x": 1980,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "STAGE 1d \u00b7 profile.md (DERIVED)  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\n\nLossy front-stage compression of 1b + 1c.\nWritten in the persona's own voice \u2014 rule-shaped,\naspirational, slightly self-flattering, sometimes\nwrong.\n\nAgent reads character_sketch + judgment + life_context\n(paginated) and Avery's sample profile as shape\ntemplate, then writes the compressed front-stage.\nThe drift vs. back-stage truth is STRUCTURAL.",
      "originalText": "STAGE 1d \u00b7 profile.md (DERIVED)  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\n\nLossy front-stage compression of 1b + 1c.\nWritten in the persona's own voice \u2014 rule-shaped,\naspirational, slightly self-flattering, sometimes\nwrong.\n\nAgent reads character_sketch + judgment + life_context\n(paginated) and Avery's sample profile as shape\ntemplate, then writes the compressed front-stage.\nThe drift vs. back-stage truth is STRUCTURAL.",
