    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "inversion_callout_text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1014,
      "width": 2350,
      "height": 42,
      "text": "\u2605 THE INVERSION \u2605   Back-stage truth (1b, 1c) is generated FIRST.   profile.md (1d) is DERIVED from it as a deliberately lossy compression.\nGoffman: the back-stage exists prior to the performance. The drift between profile.md and judgment.md is structural \u2014 generated by the compression, not patched in.",
      "originalText": "\u2605 THE INVERSION \u2605   Back-stage truth (1b, 1c) is generated FIRST.   profile.md (1d) is DERIVED from it as a deliberately lossy compression.\nGoffman: the back-stage exists prior to the performance. The drift between profile.md and judgment.md is structural \u2014 generated by the compression, not patched in.",
