    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_2_text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "STAGE 2 \u00b7 Cast  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\nStructured tool: add_cast_member()\n\nP0\u2013P1 cast members each get a multi-paragraph profile\nas prose (who they are, what they want, how they\nspeak, what makes them go quiet). P2 gets one\nparagraph. P3\u2013P4 listed with name + role.\n\nAgent writes cast.md in multiple passes (P0 \u2192 P1 \u2192 P2)\nand calls add_cast_member() per P0\u2013P1 for cast_ids.json.\n\n[PROSE] cast.md     [STRUCT] cast_ids.json (sidecar)",
      "originalText": "STAGE 2 \u00b7 Cast  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\nStructured tool: add_cast_member()\n\nP0\u2013P1 cast members each get a multi-paragraph profile\nas prose (who they are, what they want, how they\nspeak, what makes them go quiet). P2 gets one\nparagraph. P3\u2013P4 listed with name + role.\n\nAgent writes cast.md in multiple passes (P0 \u2192 P1 \u2192 P2)\nand calls add_cast_member() per P0\u2013P1 for cast_ids.json.\n\n[PROSE] cast.md     [STRUCT] cast_ids.json (sidecar)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
