    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_3_text",
      "x": 630,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "STAGE 3 \u00b7 Day Archetypes  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\n\n5\u20137 typical day shapes as prose. Each archetype gets\na section with a title (normal / crisis / deep_work /\nfamily_heavy / big_meeting / weekend / recovery) and\n1\u20132 paragraphs.\n\nAgent reads upstream foundation, then writes the\narchetypes file. Schedule details inside prose\n('she's in by 7:45...'), not tables.\n\n[PROSE] day_archetypes.md",
      "originalText": "STAGE 3 \u00b7 Day Archetypes  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\n\n5\u20137 typical day shapes as prose. Each archetype gets\na section with a title (normal / crisis / deep_work /\nfamily_heavy / big_meeting / weekend / recovery) and\n1\u20132 paragraphs.\n\nAgent reads upstream foundation, then writes the\narchetypes file. Schedule details inside prose\n('she's in by 7:45...'), not tables.\n\n[PROSE] day_archetypes.md",
      "fontSize": 11,
