    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_4_text",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "STAGE 4 \u00b7 Channels  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\n\nHow the persona uses each channel. Which carries\nwhich conversation. Which tools matter for their work.\n\nWritten as prose:\n'Email is where the deal work happens \u2014 Marcus, Ben,\nDiane all live in her inbox. Slack carries internal\nteam conversation; she's terse there.'\n\n[PROSE] channels.md",
      "originalText": "STAGE 4 \u00b7 Channels  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\n\nHow the persona uses each channel. Which carries\nwhich conversation. Which tools matter for their work.\n\nWritten as prose:\n'Email is where the deal work happens \u2014 Marcus, Ben,\nDiane all live in her inbox. Slack carries internal\nteam conversation; she's terse there.'\n\n[PROSE] channels.md",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
