    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_5_text",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "STAGE 5 \u00b7 Storylines + plans  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop \u00b7 the heaviest authoring stage\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\nStructured tools: add_storyline, declare_digest_moment,\n  declare_noise_event, declare_planned_artifact\n\n5\u201310 narrative arcs over 35 days. PHASED long arcs\n(raise \u2192 diligence \u2192 IC \u2192 close). MID-WINDOW\nresolution and mid-window emergence. Short micro-arcs\ncoexist with long arcs. Cast IN SENTENCES, NOT lists.\n\nPer storyline, agent writes plan.md containing:\nnarrative arc + declared digest moments (target morning,\nsection, priority, rationale) + noise events with\nlifecycle effects + planned artifacts.\n\n[PROSE] storylines/<id>/plan.md (one per storyline)\n[STRUCT] storyline_ids.json (thin sidecar)",
      "originalText": "STAGE 5 \u00b7 Storylines + plans  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop \u00b7 the heaviest authoring stage\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write, Edit\nStructured tools: add_storyline, declare_digest_moment,\n  declare_noise_event, declare_planned_artifact\n\n5\u201310 narrative arcs over 35 days. PHASED long arcs\n(raise \u2192 diligence \u2192 IC \u2192 close). MID-WINDOW\nresolution and mid-window emergence. Short micro-arcs\ncoexist with long arcs. Cast IN SENTENCES, NOT lists.\n\nPer storyline, agent writes plan.md containing:\nnarrative arc + declared digest moments (target morning,\nsection, priority, rationale) + noise events with\nlifecycle effects + planned artifacts.\n\n[PROSE] storylines/<id>/plan.md (one per storyline)\n[STRUCT] storyline_ids.json (thin sidecar)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
