    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_6_text",
      "x": 2070,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "STAGE 6 \u00b7 Window Plan  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\nStructured tool: add_initial_calendar_event\n\nNarrative outline of the 35 days, roughly week-by-week\n(5 weeks). Storyline beats land where they naturally\nland. Which arcs resolve and roughly when.\nWarm-up/eval boundary at Day 6.\n\n[PROSE] window_plan.md\n[STRUCT] graph/initial_calendar.json",
      "originalText": "STAGE 6 \u00b7 Window Plan  (AGENT)\nOpus 4.7 agent loop\nFile tools: Read (paginated), Write\nStructured tool: add_initial_calendar_event\n\nNarrative outline of the 35 days, roughly week-by-week\n(5 weeks). Storyline beats land where they naturally\nland. Which arcs resolve and roughly when.\nWarm-up/eval boundary at Day 6.\n\n[PROSE] window_plan.md\n[STRUCT] graph/initial_calendar.json",
