    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_7_text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "STAGE 7  \u00b7  Living the Day   (rendering only \u00b7 NO plot authority \u00b7 one agent loop per day \u00b7 Opus 4.7 \u00d7 35 \u00b7 prompt-cached static foundation)\n\nEach day's agent reads (cached): the foundation docs + today's pre-declared events from every storyline's plan.md.  Renders pre-declared artifacts via emit_email / write_note / add_calendar_op in persona voice.  Writes daily_state + activity_log entries describing the persona's experience.  Texture noise (small ambient details) is allowed; plot-level noise is reserved to Stage 5.",
      "originalText": "STAGE 7  \u00b7  Living the Day   (rendering only \u00b7 NO plot authority \u00b7 one agent loop per day \u00b7 Opus 4.7 \u00d7 35 \u00b7 prompt-cached static foundation)\n\nEach day's agent reads (cached): the foundation docs + today's pre-declared events from every storyline's plan.md.  Renders pre-declared artifacts via emit_email / write_note / add_calendar_op in persona voice.  Writes daily_state + activity_log entries describing the persona's experience.  Texture noise (small ambient details) is allowed; plot-level noise is reserved to Stage 5.",
