    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "stage_9b_txt",
      "x": 170,
      "y": 3180,
      "width": 2330,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "STAGE 9b  \u00b7  Assembly   (DETERMINISTIC WALK \u00b7 NO LLM judgment per morning)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFor each morning M \u2208 Days 6\u201335: walk every storyline plan.md, apply lifecycle effects ordered by effective_from,\nconsult internal/validation_log.jsonl, emit ideal_digests/morning_NN.json. Pure temporal arithmetic over\ndeclarative ground truth \u2014 every item is provenance-linked to its declared moment + lifecycle history + validation entry.\nOptionally, one thin LLM call per morning produces a reasoning.md narration for human inspection.\n\n\u2192  ideal_digests/morning_06.json  \u2026  morning_35.json   (30 files; thin schema with moment_id, storyline_id,\n                                                          lifecycle_history[], validation_status,\n                                                          section/priority/action_class, supporting_artifact_ids)\n\u2192  ideal_digests/morning_06.reasoning.md  \u2026  morning_35.reasoning.md   (30 optional narration files)",
      "originalText": "STAGE 9b  \u00b7  Assembly   (DETERMINISTIC WALK \u00b7 NO LLM judgment per morning)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFor each morning M \u2208 Days 6\u201335: walk every storyline plan.md, apply lifecycle effects ordered by effective_from,\nconsult internal/validation_log.jsonl, emit ideal_digests/morning_NN.json. Pure temporal arithmetic over\ndeclarative ground truth \u2014 every item is provenance-linked to its declared moment + lifecycle history + validation entry.\nOptionally, one thin LLM call per morning produces a reasoning.md narration for human inspection.\n\n\u2192  ideal_digests/morning_06.json  \u2026  morning_35.json   (30 files; thin schema with moment_id, storyline_id,\n                                                          lifecycle_history[], validation_status,\n                                                          section/priority/action_class, supporting_artifact_ids)\n\u2192  ideal_digests/morning_06.reasoning.md  \u2026  morning_35.reasoning.md   (30 optional narration files)",
      "fontSize": 11,
