      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "STAGE 9a  \u00b7  Validation   (parallel-per-moment fan-out)   \u2605 Opus 4.7 LLM agents\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFor each declared digest moment in any internal/storylines/<id>/plan.md whose final lifecycle == DECLARED and target_morning \u2208 Days 6\u201335,\nspawn one validation agent. Each agent reads: artifacts visible by morning M  +  graph/calendar_snapshots/calendar_day_(M-1).ics\n+  internal/daily_state/day_(M-1).md  +  character_sketch.md  +  judgment.md\nand answers ONE narrow question \u2014 'given this past, is this declared moment still internally consistent?'\n\nTools:  Read \u00b7 Glob \u00b7 validation_pass(moment_id, justification) \u00b7 validation_fail(moment_id, reason, severity) \u00b7 validation_correct(moment_id, corrected_rationale, ...)\nOutputs:  internal/validation_log.jsonl  (one entry per active declared moment; ~80\u2013150 entries per persona)\n\nChecks:  coherence (rationale matches artifacts) \u00b7 currency (action not already taken) \u00b7 cross-item consistency \u00b7 persona fit \u00b7 cascade integrity",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STAGE 9a  \u00b7  Validation   (parallel-per-moment fan-out)   \u2605 Opus 4.7 LLM agents\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFor each declared digest moment in any internal/storylines/<id>/plan.md whose final lifecycle == DECLARED and target_morning \u2208 Days 6\u201335,\nspawn one validation agent. Each agent reads: artifacts visible by morning M  +  graph/calendar_snapshots/calendar_day_(M-1).ics\n+  internal/daily_state/day_(M-1).md  +  character_sketch.md  +  judgment.md\nand answers ONE narrow question \u2014 'given this past, is this declared moment still internally consistent?'\n\nTools:  Read \u00b7 Glob \u00b7 validation_pass(moment_id, justification) \u00b7 validation_fail(moment_id, reason, severity) \u00b7 validation_correct(moment_id, corrected_rationale, ...)\nOutputs:  internal/validation_log.jsonl  (one entry per active declared moment; ~80\u2013150 entries per persona)\n\nChecks:  coherence (rationale matches artifacts) \u00b7 currency (action not already taken) \u00b7 cross-item consistency \u00b7 persona fit \u00b7 cascade integrity",
